---------------------- STRIP THEORY OPTIONS --------------------------------------
             1   WaveDisp       - Method of computing Wave Kinematics {0: use undisplaced position, 1: use displaced position) } (switch)
             1   AMMod          - Method of computing distributed added-mass force. (0: Only and always on nodes below SWL at the undisplaced position. 2: Up to the instantaneous free surface) [overwrite to 0 when WaveMod = 0 or 6 or when WaveStMod = 0 in SeaState]
